WEBVTT

1
00:00.900 --> 00:07.940
In VS Code, open the HUD, outline Stage files next to Review changes, and tap Middle. The light turns purple.

2
00:08.090 --> 00:13.040
Circle clockwise to add the next file to the set, or anticlockwise to drop the last one.

3
00:13.190 --> 00:16.781
After a pause, a quick nudge down or up moves one file.

4
00:16.931 --> 00:22.377
Hold Middle for about half a second to stage the whole set. You stay in Stage files, ready for the next one.

5
00:22.527 --> 00:24.917
Tap Middle once to cancel and leave.
